&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryByCod DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryByCod :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

OPEN QUERY  {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK          WHERE
            {&TableName}.cod-emitente    >= v-ini-cliente       AND
            {&TableName}.cod-emitente    <= v-fim-cliente       AND
            {&TableName}.cc-codigo       >= v-ini-centro-custo  AND
            {&TableName}.cc-codigo       <= v-fim-centro-custo.
RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

